{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CftKEYZpYcovUatETu8pe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Fix first: show customers what happens after they submit (Steps 2–3)\n\nThe calls asking \"did my bank change work?\" come from Steps 2 and 3. The confirmation page says nothing useful, and the next day the dashboard looks like the change never happened. Someone paying by direct debit fears a missed payment more than anything, so the safe move is to phone support.\n\n**This sprint:**\n1. **Confirmation page:** \"We're switching your Direct Debit to the account ending 8821. Your payment of £X on 3 Nov will still come from the account ending 4417. From [date] it will come from 8821.\" Send the same message by email so customers have a record.\n2. **Dashboard pending state:** show \"Change in progress: account ending 8821 from [date]\" next to the account ending 4417, not just the old account on its own.\n3. **Check first:** make sure the next-morning dashboard is just a processing delay and not a failed change. If requests can fail quietly, that's the real top priority, and customers need to be told when it happens.\n\nThe risk is effective dates. If the back end doesn't expose them, use a rule-based estimate (\"usually within 10 working days\") and say which payment is affected. Don't hold this work back waiting for exact dates.\n\n## Bundle in if there's room (cheap, lowers errors)\n\n- **Step 1:** accept dashes and spaces in the sort code and strip them silently. Keep what the customer typed after an error, and replace \"Invalid input\" with a message on the specific field.\n- **Buttons:** make Submit the clear primary button and Cancel a secondary or text link, so nobody cancels by mistake.\n\n## Later\n\nBank account validation (a modulus check on the sort code and account number) and a status history.\n\n**Measure:** the volume of \"did my bank change work?\" calls before and after the release."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3193,"cache_read_input_tokens":5140,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3193},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7cf98ed8-ab25-4238-a5e1-93d90219e6b1","uuid":"67b886b1-162a-4e8f-a9f8-656f7a8ff5f6","timestamp":"2026-10-10T09:25:02.777Z","request_id":"req_011CftKEXut2MBzcmJHbrQYq"}
